==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|gaderere}}, {{m|enm|gaderare}}, equivalent to {{af|en|gather|-er|id2=agent noun}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[person]] who [[gather]]s things.
# {{lb|en|business}} A person who [[collect]]s [[rent]] or [[tax]]es.
# {{lb|en|textiles}} An attachment to a [[sewing machine]] for making gathers in the cloth.
# {{lb|en|glassblowing}} A worker who collects [[molten]] [[glass]] on the end of a [[rod]] preparatory to [[blow]]ing.

